{"id":"15263460","articleId":"13364254","title":"Does Polymarket have an API?","description":"Getting data from Polymarket","blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Yes! Developers can find all the information they need for interacting with Polymarket. This includes <b><a href=\"https://docs.polymarket.com/quickstart/introduction/main\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">documentation on market discovery, resolution, trading etc.</a></b>","class":"no-margin"},{"type":"paragraph","text":" ","class":"no-margin"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Whether you are an academic researcher a market maker or an indepedent developer, this documentation should provide you what you need to get started. All the code you find linked here and on our <b><a href=\"https://github.com/polymarket\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">GitHub</a></b> is open source and free to use.","class":"no-margin"},{"type":"paragraph","text":" ","class":"no-margin"},{"type":"callout","content":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"If you have any questions please join our <b><a href=\"https://discord.com/invite/polymarket\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Discord</a></b> and direct your questions to the #devs channel.","class":"no-margin"}],"style":{"backgroundColor":"#e3e7fa80","borderColor":"#334bfa33"}},{"type":"paragraph","text":" ","class":"no-margin"}],"markdown":null,"author":null,"collectionId":"17859622","targetUserType":"everyone","lastUpdated":"Updated over 7 months ago","lastUpdatedDate":"2026-01-11T21:35:49Z","showTableOfContents":true,"synced":false,"relatedArticles":[{"title":"What is Polymarket","url":"https://help.polymarket.com/en/articles/13364060-what-is-polymarket"},{"title":"Polymarket vs. Polling","url":"https://help.polymarket.com/en/articles/13364238-polymarket-vs-polling"},{"title":"Polymarket Exchange Upgrade: April 28, 2026","url":"https://help.polymarket.com/en/articles/14762452-polymarket-exchange-upgrade-april-28-2026"}],"locale":"en","breadcrumbs":[{"url":"https://help.polymarket.com/en/collections/17859622-faqs","name":"FAQs"}],"canonicalUrl":"https://help.polymarket.com/en/articles/13364254-does-polymarket-have-an-api","selectedReaction":null,"showReactions":true}